1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,675
雪の夜 灯がひとつ
A night of snow, a single light

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,625
名を呼べば 息は白く
I call your name; my breath turns white

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,400
結んでくれた 赤い紐
The red cord you tied for me

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,925
鈴がまだ揺れる
its little bell still sways

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:26,900
ねえちゃん
Sister...

6
00:00:28,125 --> 00:00:28,775
ねえちゃん
Sister...

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:29,950
返せ
Give it back

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,250
返せ
Give it back

9
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:33,925
あの灯を
that light

10
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:43,900
鳴れ 鳴れ 宵の鐘
Ring, ring, evening bell

11
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,913
闇を裂いて 波よ立て
Split the dark; rise, you waves

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,938
消えない灯を この胸に
A light that will not die, here in my heart

13
00:00:55,500 --> 00:01:01,300
明日の岸へ 渡すまで
until I carry it to tomorrow's shore
